      "name": "CreateThreadWithParamBlock",
      "signature": "ThreadParamBlock * CreateThreadWithParamBlock(uint dwParam1, uint dwParam2, uint dwParam3)",
      "comment": "Allocates a parameter block and creates a worker thread with the specified parameters.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Allocate 20-byte ThreadParamBlock structure using RadMalloc(0x14)\n2. Validate allocation succeeded - return NULL on failure  \n3. Store dwParam1, dwParam2, dwParam3 in structure fields 0x0, 0x4, 0x8\n4. Call CreateThread with FUN_1000aae0 as thread procedure and pParamBlock as parameter\n5. Store thread handle in structure field 0xc (offset +12)  \n6. Validate thread creation succeeded - free memory and return NULL on failure\n7. Return pointer to populated ThreadParamBlock structure\n\nParameters:\ndwParam1 (uint) - First parameter to pass to worker thread\ndwParam2 (uint) - Second parameter to pass to worker thread  \ndwParam3 (uint) - Third parameter to pass to worker thread\n\nReturns:\nThreadParamBlock* - Pointer to allocated parameter block containing thread data on success\nNULL - Memory allocation or thread creation failure\n\nSpecial Cases:\nRadMalloc(0x14) failure - Returns NULL immediately without cleanup\nCreateThread failure - Frees allocated memory via RadFree before returning NULL\nThread ID stored at offset 0x10 - Used as lpThreadId parameter to CreateThread\n\nStructure Layout:\nOffset | Size | Field Name | Type | Description\n-------|------|------------|------|-------------\n0x00   | 4    | dwParam1   | uint | First thread parameter\n0x04   | 4    | dwParam2   | uint | Second thread parameter  \n0x08   | 4    | dwParam3   | uint | Third thread parameter\n0x0C   | 4    | hThread    | uint | Thread handle from CreateThread\n0x10   | 4    | dwThreadId | uint | Thread ID from CreateThread\n\nError Handling:\nMemory allocation failure - Return NULL without side effects\nThread creation failure - Call RadFree(pParamBlock) to prevent memory leak",
