      "name": "InitializePerformanceTimer",
      "signature": "undefined8 InitializePerformanceTimer(void)",
      "comment": "Initialize performance timing system and get initial timestamp\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Read processor timestamp counter using RDTSC instruction\n2. Set global initialization flag to prevent re-initialization\n3. Return 64-bit timestamp value for timing measurements\n\nParameters:\n(none)\n\nReturns:\n64-bit timestamp from processor's time stamp counter (TSC)\nUsed for high-resolution performance timing measurements\n\nSpecial Cases:\nCalled only once during YUV subsystem initialization to establish timing baseline\nGlobal flag prevents multiple initialization attempts",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
