      "comment": "Analyzes floating-point number precision by counting binary fractional digits.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if input equals its rounded integer value\n2. If equal (integer), return 0\n3. If not equal, multiply by 0.5 and increment counter  \n4. Repeat rounding check after multiplication\n5. Return counter value (0-2 precision levels)\n\nParameters:\nldNumber (float10): Extended precision floating-point number to analyze\n\nReturns:\nint: Precision counter indicating fractional digit levels\n- 0: Already integer, 1: Half-precision, 2: Quarter-precision",
