      "name": "BinkSetFrameRate",
      "signature": "void BinkSetFrameRate(uint dwFrameRateNumerator, uint dwFrameRateDenominator)",
      "comment": "Sets the frame rate for Bink video playback by storing frame rate parameters to global variables.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Store frame rate numerator to global variable g_dwBinkFrameRateNumerator\n2. Store frame rate denominator to global variable g_dwBinkFrameRateDenominator\n\nParameters:\ndwFrameRateNumerator (uint): Frame rate numerator value for Bink video playback\ndwFrameRateDenominator (uint): Frame rate denominator value for Bink video playback\n\nReturns:\nvoid: Function does not return a value\n\nSpecial Cases:\nFrame rate is represented as a fraction (numerator/denominator) allowing for precise frame timing control in Bink video codec.\n\nGlobal Variables Modified:\ng_dwBinkFrameRateNumerator (0x1002a070): Stores the frame rate numerator\ng_dwBinkFrameRateDenominator (0x1002f564): Stores the frame rate denominator",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
