      "comment": "Sets the resolution parameters for the Bink video buffer subsystem\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Store width parameter to global buffer width variable\n2. Store height parameter to global buffer height variable  \n3. Store color depth parameter to global buffer color depth variable\n4. Return to caller (no validation performed)\n\nParameters:\n  dwWidth (uint): Video buffer width in pixels\n  dwHeight (uint): Video buffer height in pixels  \n  dwColorDepth (uint): Color depth/format identifier for buffer\n\nReturns:\n  void: Function completes synchronously with no return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  No parameter validation - accepts any 32-bit values\n  Previous resolution settings are overwritten without preservation\n  Global state change affects all subsequent Bink buffer operations\n\nGlobal State Modified:\n  g_dwBinkBufferWidth (0x1002f12c): Stores current buffer width\n  g_dwBinkBufferHeight (0x1002f130): Stores current buffer height\n  g_dwBinkBufferColorDepth (0x1002f134): Stores current buffer color format",
